{"id":10396,"date":"2026-03-10T13:21:33","date_gmt":"2026-03-10T13:21:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/?p=10396"},"modified":"2026-03-10T13:21:33","modified_gmt":"2026-03-10T13:21:33","slug":"strange-noises-in-the-roof-you-may-need-possum-removal-in-melbourne","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/strange-noises-in-the-roof-you-may-need-possum-removal-in-melbourne\/","title":{"rendered":"Strange Noises in the Roof? You May Need Possum Removal in Melbourne"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hearing scratching, thumping, or movement in your roof at night can be worrying. Many homeowners in Melbourne experience this problem, especially during the cooler months when animals look for warm shelter. If the noise usually happens after sunset or late at night, there is a good chance that a possum has found its way into your roof.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Possums are common in Melbourne. While they may look harmless outside, they can cause problems when they start living inside roofs, ceilings, or wall spaces. In such situations, professional <\/span><b>possum pest control Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> services become important to safely remove the animal and prevent further damage.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Understanding the signs early can help you act quickly before the situation becomes worse.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><b>Why Possums Enter Roof Spaces<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-10398\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-06-at-6.13.33-PM-300x169.jpeg\" alt=\" Possum Removal Melbourne\" width=\"705\" height=\"397\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-06-at-6.13.33-PM-300x169.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-06-at-6.13.33-PM-1024x576.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-06-at-6.13.33-PM-768x432.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-06-at-6.13.33-PM.jpeg 1280w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 705px) 100vw, 705px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Possums are naturally attracted to warm and safe places where they can sleep during the day. Roof spaces provide the perfect shelter because they are quiet, dark, and protected from predators.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In Melbourne suburbs, homes often have small roof gaps, broken tiles, or open vents that allow possums to enter. Once they discover a comfortable spot, they may continue returning every night.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Possums usually become more active during the night. This is why homeowners often hear scratching, walking, or banging sounds after dark.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When this happens, it is best to consider professional <\/span><b>possum removal in Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> before the animal becomes fully settled inside your roof.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><b>Common Signs You May Have a Possum in Your Roof<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Sometimes the sounds on the roof can be confusing. Many people first think it might be rats or birds. However, possums usually make heavier and louder noises compared to smaller pests.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here are a few signs that may indicate a possum problem:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Loud Movement at Night<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Possums are larger animals, so their footsteps often sound like heavy thumping or walking above the ceiling.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Scratching or Dragging Sounds<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You might hear scratching noises as possums move around or build nesting areas.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Unpleasant Smell<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If possums stay on the roof for a long time, droppings and urine can create a strong smell.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Roof Damage<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Possums sometimes damage roof tiles, insulation, or wiring while moving around.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Garden or Tree Activity<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you frequently see possums in nearby trees or around your roof at night, they may already be entering your house.<\/span><\/p>\n<h2><b>Why You Should Not Try to Remove a Possum Yourself<\/b><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Many homeowners think they can simply chase the possum away or block the entry hole. However, removing possums without proper knowledge can create bigger problems.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In Australia, possums are protected animals. This means they cannot be harmed or relocated far away from their home area. Special rules apply to how possums must be handled and released.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Because of these regulations, professional pest control companies follow safe and legal methods for removal.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Experts who provide <\/span><b>best possum removal Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> services understand the correct way to capture and relocate possums without harming them.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Trying to remove them without proper equipment or knowledge may lead to injury or damage to your home.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>How Professional Possum Removal Works<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A trained pest control team will first inspect the roof to identify where the possum is entering. This step is important because blocking the entry point without removing the animal can trap it inside.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Professional <\/span><b>possum pest control Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> services usually follow a simple process:<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Roof Inspection<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The technician checks the roof, attic, and surrounding areas to locate entry points.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Safe Possum Trapping<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A humane trap is used to capture the possum safely without causing harm.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Legal Relocation<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The possum is released according to Australian wildlife rules, usually close to its original territory.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Entry Point Sealing<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">After removal, all possible entry points are sealed to prevent the possum from returning.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Prevention Advice<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Homeowners receive advice on how to keep their roofs possum-free in the future.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This method ensures the problem is solved without harming the animal or damaging the property.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><b>Why Possum Problems Should Not Be Ignored<\/b><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ignoring possum activity in the roof can lead to several problems over time.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Damage to Roof and Insulation<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Possums often move insulation around and can damage roof materials.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Health Concerns<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Possum droppings and urine can create unpleasant smells and hygiene issues.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Noise Disturbance<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Constant noise at night can disturb sleep and create stress for homeowners.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Risk of Other Pests<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Open roof gaps used by possums may also allow rats, birds, or insects to enter the house.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This is why early <\/span><b>possum removal in Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> is always recommended.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><b>Preventing Possums from Returning<\/b><\/h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">After possums are removed, it is important to make sure they cannot come back again.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Here are some simple prevention tips homeowners can follow:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Trim tree branches that touch the roof<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Repair broken roof tiles and vents<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Close gaps around eaves and roof edges<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Install possum-proof roof covers if needed<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Avoid leaving food sources outside at night<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Professional pest control technicians often provide advice on these steps during the removal process.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Taking these precautions can help reduce the chances of future possum problems.<\/span><\/p>\n<h5><b>Choosing the Best Possum Removal Service in Melbourne<\/b><\/h5>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone  wp-image-10399\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-06-at-6.43.49-PM-300x200.jpeg\" alt=\" Possum Removal Melbourne\" width=\"735\" height=\"490\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-06-at-6.43.49-PM-300x200.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-06-at-6.43.49-PM-1024x683.jpeg 1024w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-06-at-6.43.49-PM-768x512.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/WhatsApp-Image-2026-03-06-at-6.43.49-PM.jpeg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 735px) 100vw, 735px\" \/><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Not all pest control services handle possum problems properly. When choosing a company, it is important to select professionals who follow legal and humane removal practices.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Look for companies that offer:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Licensed pest control technicians<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Humane possum trapping methods<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Roof inspection and entry point repairs<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Local experience with Melbourne homes<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Reliable and fast response times<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">A trusted pest control company like <\/span><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> provides professional <\/span><b>possum pest control Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> services designed to solve the problem quickly and safely. Their experienced team understands how common possum problems are in Melbourne homes and uses humane, legal methods to remove them without causing harm.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The technicians at <\/span><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> start with a detailed roof inspection to find where the possum is entering.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">They then use safe trapping methods and follow Australian wildlife regulations when relocating the animal. After the possum is removed, the team also helps identify and seal entry points to stop possums from coming back again.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">What makes <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/\"><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> a reliable choice is their focus on both removal and prevention.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Instead of just removing the possum, they also guide homeowners on how to keep their roofs protected in the future. Their local knowledge of Melbourne homes allows them to quickly identify common entry points and solve the problem efficiently.<\/span><\/p>\n<h6><b>When to Call a Possum Removal Expert<\/b><\/h6>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you hear repeated noises in the roof, especially late at night, it is best to contact a professional as soon as possible.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The sooner the issue is handled, the easier it is to prevent damage to your home.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Professional <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/our-services\/possum-pest-control\/\"><b>possum removal Melbourne<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> services can quickly inspect the situation and recommend the right solution.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Many homeowners wait too long before calling experts, which allows the possum to become comfortable and stay longer on the roof.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Early action always saves time, money, and stress.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Strange noises in the roof are never pleasant, especially when they disturb your sleep or make you worry about possible damage. In Melbourne, possums are one of the most common reasons behind these nighttime sounds.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">While possums are an important part of the local wildlife, they should not live inside your home. Professional <\/span><b>possum pest control Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> services help remove them safely while following all wildlife regulations.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">If you are hearing strange noises in your roof, it may be time to take action. The experienced team at <\/span><b>7 States Pest Control<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> provides safe and reliable <\/span><b>possum pest control Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> services to remove possums and prevent them from returning.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/contact-us\/\"><b>Book a professional possum removal service today<\/b><\/a><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Hearing scratching, thumping, or movement in your roof at night can be worrying. Many homeowners in Melbourne experience this problem, especially during the cooler months when animals look for warm shelter. If the noise usually happens after sunset or late at night, there is a good chance that a possum has found its way into [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":10397,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[20,14],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-10396","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-mice-exterminator","category-professionals-pest-control"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v25.4 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/wordpress\/plugins\/seo\/ -->\n<title>Possum Removal Melbourne | Stop Roof Noises Fast<\/title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"Hearing strange noises on your roof? Learn why you may need possum removal in Melbourne and how professional pest control can safely solve the problem.\" \/>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/strange-noises-in-the-roof-you-may-need-possum-removal-in-melbourne\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Possum Removal Melbourne | Stop Roof Noises Fast\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Hearing strange noises on your roof? Learn why you may need possum removal in Melbourne and how professional pest control can safely solve the problem.\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/strange-noises-in-the-roof-you-may-need-possum-removal-in-melbourne\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n<meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2026-03-10T13:21:33+00:00\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/03\/7-states-7.png\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:width\" content=\"1200\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:height\" content=\"630\" \/>\n\t<meta property=\"og:image:type\" content=\"image\/png\" \/>\n<meta name=\"author\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" \/>\n<meta name=\"twitter:label1\" content=\"Written by\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data1\" content=\"7 States Pest Control\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:label2\" content=\"Est. reading time\" \/>\n\t<meta name=\"twitter:data2\" content=\"7 minutes\" \/>\n<script type=\"application\/ld+json\" class=\"yoast-schema-graph\">{\"@context\":\"https:\/\/schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"